Jukka Lahtinen <jtfjdehf@hotmail.com.invalid> wrote:

> paxed@alt.org (Pasi Kallinen) writes:
> 
>> This patch allows certain monsters to use containers they carry.
>> Each turn the monster is able to do something, it might take
>> a random item out of the container.  Monsters won't use cursed
>> bags of holding, locked or trapped containers, nor bag of tricks.
> 
> So, with the patch, there is one more way to tell cursed bags of holding
> apart from other bags. If you see a monster use a bag, it's safe for the
> contents.
> 

I agree. I think it would be much better balanced if the patch DID let 
monsters use cursed bags of holding: you'ld still learn it was cursed, but 
it would be because you see most of its contents vapourise.

Only tamed monsters should be able to tell the cursed status. Others should 
just loot away regardless.


